MCP tool actually returns (trust level, validity, key ID, signer ---
see \S~``MCP Tool Surface'' above); the seven-step Verify Flow above
computes it, but is not itself formalised step by step, in keeping
with this document's level of abstraction: the schemas here fix the
\emph{decision logic} (what a given verification outcome means), not
the byte-level GPG plumbing that produces it.

